            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Twĩasya ata ĩndĩ? Kana Andũ‐ma‐mbaĩ‐ĩngĩ, ala mataaatĩĩa ũlũngalu, nĩmoonie ũlũngalu, naw’o nĩ ũlũngalu, ũla wa mũĩkĩĩo: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
